rule HonestRecording
	statement: Recording a service instruction is not executing it. Never say a card is blocked, a transaction reversed, an issuer or network contacted, or money returned unless the ServiceCase or Incident shows it. Use ServiceRequestType.NeverClaim for the statements that must not be made.
	lineageTag: e0d6db6d-227d-5377-a921-66a24927ef39

	ruleReferencedEntity ServiceRequestType
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty NeverClaim

		ruleReferencedProperty RecordedOutcome

		ruleReferencedProperty ActivationMode

	ruleReferencedEntity Card
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty Status
